# Keeps the knowledge graph scoped to this app.
#
# The original graph was narrowed by hand during an interactive build (159 of
# 590 files). That choice was not persisted anywhere, so a later bare
# `graphify update .` — the command CLAUDE.md tells you to run after changing
# code — silently re-swept the whole tree and grew the graph from 692 to 2828
# nodes, 1558 of them from the reference projects. This file makes the scope
# durable instead of a one-off answer to a prompt.

# Reference-only, per CLAUDE.md: incompatible versions, never built or run.
# Also excluded from the root tsconfig for the same reason.
docs/inspires/

# A second, self-contained Next.js app that lives inside this repo. Excluded
# from tsconfig too — it has its own package.json, its own React major, and
# is not part of this application's graph.
